      "en": "that we may buy the poor for silver, and the needy for a pair of sandals, and sell the sweepings with the wheat?’”",
      "ko": "은으로 가난한 자를 사며 신 한 켤레로 궁핍한 자를 사며 잿밀을 팔자 하는도다",
      "source_text_hash": "c5e4fc16cb663606567d14f65996dc4df512aa2f71ff342ab7548137e558c26b",
      "translation_text_hash": "c1997a7eda41e8a9c929c51e165f6e6657c4f10821ac3cefa5f131ea5b5586df",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
